      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2025-09-30T08:48:05.054Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi,</p>\n<p>Is it possible in Frappe to have <strong>different Select options per row in a child table</strong>?</p>\n<p>From what I tested, when I use <code>update_docfield_property(\"options\", ...)</code>, it updates the options globally for the entire column (all rows).</p>\n<p>Is there any supported way to make each row show its own Select options, or is the only workaround to use a Data field with Autocomplete?</p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
